"""
fig3_sbd_seasonal_k_8oceans.py
Seasonal SBDART-derived COT-albedo relation (COT/SZA/CER from the L3 product).
(A) fitted k parameter
(B) fitted b parameter
(C) Ratio of Ac(1-Ac)
Fitted relation:
    Ac = COT^k / (b + COT^k)
Pre-correction references:
    (1) k=1, b=0.15*/2/3^(-1/2)=0.1299
    (2) k=1, b=0.15*/2=0.0750
    (3) CERES-SSF Ac
    (4) CERES-EBAF Ac
    (5) Ac fixed at 0.38 (no COT-albedo relation).
The last three are used only in panel (c), not to estimate or plot k or b.
Sample screens: COT >= MIN_COT only, plus the SBDART-LUT domain (samples
outside it get NaN Ac). A pure liquid-water screen (CERES liquid cloud
fraction >= 0.99 x the CERES total cloud fraction of the same sample) is
applied only to the CERES-SSF and CERES-EBAF baselines, so that those two
original Ac values are pure-water albedos.
"""
